In-Game Guidelines
Violation of these rules can / will result in in-game punishments being taken against you.
‎‎
| Random Death Match (RDM)

- You are required to have a valid reason to kill another player (i.e Fear of Life)
- Killing someone out of roleplay or without good reason is not allowed.
‎
| Vehicle Death Match (VDM)

- Crashing into vehicles for no reason and not roleplaying it is considered VDM.
‎
| FRP & Fear Roleplay

- Roleplay must always remain realistic at all times.
- No Intent to Roleplay (NITRP) / Trolling will result in an immediate kick.
- Doing something that would realistically be physically impossible is considered Fail Roleplay.
‎
| Metagaming

- You may not decide another player's injuries.
- You may not use information discussed out of roleplay.
- You are not allowed to switch characters when you are wanted.
‎
| LTAA & LTAP

- Leaving the game whilst in cuffs or being booked is considered LTAA.
- Leaving the game while actively being moderated is considered LTAP.
- Both violations will lead to an immediate ban.
‎
| New Life Rule

- Once a character dies, you are required to forget everything from that character's life.
- You may not return to a previous roleplay / scene.
‎
| Maintaining Realism

- Your avatar must remain realistic at all times.
- This includes anything from unrealistic proportions to a non-human skin tone.
‎
| Green Teams

- You are not permitted to kill any FD, DOT, on-duty Staff, or on-duty Media by all circumstances.
- You are also not allowed to take these teams hostage or target them intentionally.
‎
| GTA Driving (GTAD)

- Going over speeds of 130 MPH is considered GTAD, exempt if you are in an active LEO pursuit.
- Taking unrealistic jumps or declines in a vehicle is also GTAD.
- Driving on the wrong side of the road is also GTAD.
‎
| Scene Interference

- You are not permitted to join staff / roleplay scenes that you did not initiate or are not a part of.
‎
| Off Road Vehicles

- Lawn mowers, ATVs, and other vehicles not intended for streets are not permitted on roads, and must be hauled by a trailer.
‎
| Uniforms & Liveries

- You are required to use the uniforms and liveries provided to you by the server.
‎
| Unauthorized Teams

- Roleplaying as ICE, FBI, Secret Service, CIA, or other unestablished departments is not allowed.
‎
| Exploiting & Glitch Abuse

- Using any sort of exploit or glitch to gain an upper hand will result in an immediate ban.
‎
| DTOS & RTOS

- You are required to follow the Discord TOS and Roblox TOS at all times within our server.

Discord Server Guidelines
| Server Raiding

- Raiding our server will result in an immediate ban, along with appropriate actions taken against your Discord account.
‎
| Discrimination & Disrespect

- In our server, you are required to treat everyone with equal respect no matter their identity.
‎
| Discord TOS

- You must be 13+ to be in our server.
- This server is not marked as 18+, so therefore, you are not allowed to post references to / post NSFW content.
‎
| Appropriate Channel Usage

- Every channel has its specific use, so please use it for what it was intended.
‎
| Unnecessary / Mass Pings

- Pinging roles or spam pinging a member within a channel without a valid reason will result in a server mute for an undefined amount of time.

