S4 - Staff Roster Information
Callsigns
Every staff member is assigned a callsign that must be used within the Discord server and in-game staff operations. Failure to use it will result in a warning. Your callsign will be changed as you rank up or at Management discretion.
Promotions
Every Friday night at 9 PM CST (Central Standard Time), mass promotions take place; you are promoted for exceeding expectations and showing Management that you are capable of taking on a higher rank. Your quota does contribute, however it is not the only thing considered when receiving a promotion. You may only be promoted once every other week. During these cooldowns, it is expected that you still meet quota that week. Failure to reach quota (shown on Staff Panel) will result in an activity notice and a warning. If you receive a strike, then you will not be eligible for promotion that week.
Quota amounts that make you eligible for promotion is two times your role’s quota shown in the staff panel on Melonly.





S5 - Moderation Presets 


Our moderation panel is hosted by Melonly. This section will help you to understand how to use the panel. You can access the panel by pressing the green button in Staff Information (where you found this document.
