On the middle section of the panel, you can view any server event logs, and look up players who are in the server.
On the right side, you can look up server member’s punishment logs that are properly logged by staff.










































When you search up a player, you can moderate them with the middle section. There is a button that allows you to use a preset moderation punishment to moderate someone. 
























