S7 - Infractions System


The way it works is incredibly straightforward. Infractions are based on a point system. If you break a rule, you are assigned a pre-determined number of points that are logged onto your account.


ex: Improper Parking = 1 Infraction Point


Each point has a milestone infraction. If you reach one point logged, you receive **Warning 1.** Two points logged, you're at your second warning. Reach 8, and you're out. 
Melonly will auto-suspend, auto-demote, and even auto-terminate if a staff member reaches their respective point milestones.
These points can be appealed via a form which will be posted into the staff information channel.
It also automatically strips your in-game permissions upon being suspended or terminated, and returning them if they are voided / over.



























